<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</link><description>国有煤炭印度有限公司旗下的 Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd. 将于周五在首次公开募股后开始交易，这是自印度市场监管机构禁止公布 IPO 股票所谓的灰市价格以来的首次上市。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo'&gt;Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mahanadi Coalfields Set for Mumbai Debut After $969 Million IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</link><description>日本烟草公司股价上涨，此前有消息称该卷烟制造商正在探索与奥驰亚集团公司收购帝国品牌公司的可能性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover'&gt;日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Tobacco Climbs on Potential Imperial Brands Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:26:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>国际货币基金组织认为澳大利亚 3.1 万亿美元养老金面临新风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions</link><description>国际货币基金组织指出了澳大利亚快速增长的养老金体系中出现的一系列新风险，包括随着一波工人进入退休年龄而保持更多资产流动性的挑战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions'&gt;国际货币基金组织认为澳大利亚 3.1 万亿美元养老金面临新风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：IMF Sees Emerging Risks in Australia’s $3.1 Trillion of Pensions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/imf-sees-emerging-risks-in-australia-s-3-1-trillion-of-pensions</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:15:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nifty 11 月大幅上涨为印度 IPO 有望带来顺风</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/nifty-s-sharp-november-rally-gives-india-s-ipo-hopefuls-a-tailwind</link><description>今年，各公司已通过 IPO 筹集了约 186 亿美元，预计 12 月份将出现一系列交易。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/nifty-s-sharp-november-rally-gives-india-s-ipo-hopefuls-a-tailwind'&gt;Nifty 11 月大幅上涨为印度 IPO 有望带来顺风&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nifty’s Sharp November Rally Gives India’s IPO Hopefuls a Tailwind&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-27/nifty-s-sharp-november-rally-gives-india-s-ipo-hopefuls-a-tailwind</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:30:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Offsets Rate-Hike Concerns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>